WEBVTT

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:14.300
Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.680
aoku nemuru mizu no hoshi ni sotto

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.680
Kissing softly the star of water that sleeps in blue,

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:31.410
kuchizuke shite inochi no hi wo tomosu hito yo

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:31.410
A person who lights the fire of life,

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.300
toki to iu kin'iro no sazanami wa

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.300
The time, the golden ripple,

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:45.070
oozora no kuchibiru ni umareta toiki ne

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:45.070
is a sigh from the lips of the sky,

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:49.300
kokoro ni uzumoreta

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:49.300
The stars of kindness...

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.270
yasashisa no hoshitachi ga

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.270
...buried in heart flame up...

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.440
honoo age yobiau

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.440
...and call to each other,

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:03.430
namima sasurau nanpasen no you ni

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:03.430
Like wrecked ships wandering on the waves...

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:08.870
mou nakanaide ima

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:08.870
Don't cry, any more,

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.240
anata wo sagashite iru hito ga iru kara

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.240
because now there is a person looking for you,

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.970
omae ni aitai yo to

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.970
Dying to see you...

00:01:34.090 --> 00:01:41.060
In order to move Gryps 2, the Titans started
a diversionary attack at Side 2.

00:01:41.670 --> 00:01:45.630
Rosamia joined with Kamille in this battle...

00:01:45.710 --> 00:01:49.870
...but ended up returning to
the Dogosse Gier.

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:54.960
Goodbye, Rosammy

00:02:00.790 --> 00:02:04.780
Granada has begun evacuating
in anticipation of a laser attack...

00:02:04.860 --> 00:02:07.590
...by the Gryps 2 Colony Laser.

00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:13.190
The majority of citizens are heading to the
recently completed underground passage.

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:15.730
However, there are also many
who remain in Granada...

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:17.770
...intending to fight back to the end.

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:27.180
Meanwhile, the Argama has completed
resupplying at La Vie En Rose...

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:31.780
...and together with the Radish,
set its course in the direction of Side 2.

00:02:34.450 --> 00:02:36.120
Kamille, you too?

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:41.130
You came to ask the doctor
about the Cyber-Newtype, right?

00:02:42.330 --> 00:02:43.660
- Oh, my.
- Lieutenant.

00:02:44.960 --> 00:02:48.130
Hey guys, since when did this room
become a lounge.

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:51.590
I'm not serving coffee.

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:54.770
Is it true that Rosammy
is a Cyber-Newtype?

00:02:55.540 --> 00:02:58.480
I found traces of a common
muscle enhancer...

00:02:58.550 --> 00:03:01.450
...and also excessive amounts
of kita-metallothionein in her body.

00:03:01.850 --> 00:03:03.410
The anti-radiation drug, right?

00:03:03.480 --> 00:03:04.780
Abnormally large amounts of it.

00:03:04.850 --> 00:03:05.780
Doctor.

00:03:05.850 --> 00:03:08.450
What good will creating Cyber-Newtypes
do anyway?!

00:03:10.190 --> 00:03:14.630
We doctors are always waiting
for the chance to challenge limitations.

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:17.290
Are you saying you can experiment
with a human body...

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:18.800
...as long as it's not yours?!

00:03:18.870 --> 00:03:20.330
If we can create Newtypes...

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:22.990
...rather than wait around for humans
to naturally evolve...!

00:03:23.070 --> 00:03:24.830
But then they're not really Newtypes!

00:03:25.210 --> 00:03:26.500
You're right.

00:03:26.570 --> 00:03:29.540
- That cannot be allowed!
- Kamille!

00:03:29.940 --> 00:03:32.780
The best way is to wait for nature
to take its course.

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:34.250
But if we wait around for that...

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:37.680
...Earth will deteriorate in the hands
of humanity, until it eventually dies.

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:39.720
You have a point.

00:03:42.190 --> 00:03:44.660
Lieutenant Emma, you don't look too well.

00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:45.880
Don't I?

00:03:46.460 --> 00:03:49.660
Here, why don't I give you a checkup
while you're here.

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:54.430
- Undo your top.
- N-No, I feel fine!

00:03:59.770 --> 00:04:03.040
Will you be able to fight Rosammy
if she attacks, Kamille?

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:05.070
I don't know.

00:04:05.150 --> 00:04:08.010
But she's made into a Cyber-Newtype
in order to fight, right?

00:04:08.380 --> 00:04:11.820
Cyber-Newtypes don't necessarily fight
because they want to, you know.

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:13.080
That's true...

00:04:13.150 --> 00:04:15.880
...but they've been programmed
to fight, right?

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:19.720
You can't "program" a person
to do anything!

00:04:20.930 --> 00:04:21.890
Kamille...!

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:29.570
We need to have them understand
that the A.E.U.G. saved Side 2.

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:31.600
Once we do that, the rest should be easy.

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:33.740
If we crush Gryps 2, that is.

00:04:34.010 --> 00:04:34.970
Right.

00:04:35.110 --> 00:04:37.300
Then you'll need to get in
your mobile suit, Lieutenant.

00:04:37.740 --> 00:04:39.640
I'm a pilot.

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:41.650
Don't worry about me.

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:44.620
Thinking of what you've become
since your Dakar speech...

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:47.240
...I'd rather not use you
as a pilot, Lieutenant.

00:04:48.590 --> 00:04:50.560
You know me better than that, Captain.

00:05:10.140 --> 00:05:11.010
There!

00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:19.180
I like this.

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:21.190
It reacts quicker than the Gaplant.

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:22.780
I can feel more power!

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:26.820
<i>I can sink the Argama with this!</i>
<i>I can rescue my brother from them!</i>

00:05:27.030 --> 00:05:28.290
Brother?

00:05:29.230 --> 00:05:33.290
Maybe she's become <i>too</i> close
to the Zeta Gundam's pilot.

00:05:33.830 --> 00:05:36.130
So those are Rosamia's
thought waves?

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:41.370
Can this device be used in actual battle?

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:43.810
Didn't you know, Lieutenant?

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:47.210
What connects a Cyber-Newtype
to the Psycommu System...

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:49.540
...is none other than
the Cyber-Newtype's brainwaves.

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:52.280
Unlike electromagnetic waves...

00:05:52.350 --> 00:05:55.320
...we don't have to worry about
Minovsky particles interfering.

00:05:56.190 --> 00:05:59.590
What I'm concerned about is the
Psycommu capabilities of the Baund Doc!

00:05:59.660 --> 00:06:00.630
Oh!

00:06:01.490 --> 00:06:03.690
Tell Rosamia to come out!
I'm going in next!

00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:05.460
Just a moment.

00:06:06.870 --> 00:06:09.130
<i>Lieutenant Rosamia.</i>
<i>Your session is over.</i>

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:11.170
<i>It's Lieutenant Gates' turn.</i>

00:06:15.010 --> 00:06:16.310
Lieutenant Gates.

00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:18.140
Very impressive, Lieutenant Rosamia.

00:06:18.210 --> 00:06:20.180
Thank you very much!

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:22.340
Lieutenant?

00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:24.610
That's very interesting.

00:06:24.680 --> 00:06:27.520
So Newtypes have a tendency
to attract each other.

00:06:27.620 --> 00:06:30.520
A flaw in Cyber-Newtypes
is their unstable emotional state.

00:06:31.460 --> 00:06:34.550
We must assess the Baund Doc's
abilities as well, so...!

00:06:34.630 --> 00:06:37.360
- Proceed at your discretion.
- Then excuse me, sir.

00:06:40.130 --> 00:06:40.930
What?!

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:43.530
The Alexandria's at Gryps 2?

00:06:44.700 --> 00:06:48.370
They say they cannot join our fleet
due to engine failure.

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:51.010
Captain Gady of the Alexandria...

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:54.050
...was critical of our latest
poison gas operation, wasn't he?

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:55.280
Y-Yes, sir!

00:06:56.250 --> 00:06:59.080
We'll take the Dogosse Gier
out of this operation zone...

00:06:59.150 --> 00:07:01.050
...and head for Gryps 2.

00:07:02.890 --> 00:07:04.860
I won't let the Alexandria
have things their way.

00:07:05.530 --> 00:07:08.390
Send Rosamia out in this area!

00:07:16.800 --> 00:07:18.130
<i>First deck, cleared!</i>

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:19.830
<i>Baund Doc, ready for take-off!</i>

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:21.870
<i>All maintenance crew, take shelter!</i>

00:07:32.620 --> 00:07:35.750
Just sitting here, wrapped in this cockpit...
beautiful.

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:38.250
I feel so much at ease.

00:07:47.630 --> 00:07:49.430
Lieutenant Rosamia, you're going too fast!

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:52.300
There are two people on ours,
so we can't keep up.

00:07:52.740 --> 00:07:55.110
Stop kidding me.

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:06.610
We're in Side 2 airspace.

00:08:06.690 --> 00:08:07.410
Okay!

00:08:07.490 --> 00:08:09.460
Send out our mobile suit team!

00:08:09.620 --> 00:08:12.460
We'll join with the A.E.U.G.'s
advance party!

00:08:19.370 --> 00:08:21.330
Shinta. Qum.

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:25.130
You two.

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:27.100
Of course.

00:08:27.170 --> 00:08:29.470
Rosammy's like your older sister,
after all.

00:08:30.010 --> 00:08:31.370
Shinta! Qum!

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:34.170
<i>I'll be sure to bring back Rosammy!</i>
<i>So just wait here!</i>

00:08:37.650 --> 00:08:39.140
Hyaku Shiki, taking off!

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:44.480
Gundam Mk. II, Emma, taking off!

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:57.470
Zeta Gundam, Kamille, let's do it!

00:09:09.050 --> 00:09:11.310
I cannot reach the Baund Doc team!

00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:14.380
Never mind them. We'll let
the Cyber-Newtypes do as they wish.

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:15.420
Yes, sir!

00:09:15.860 --> 00:09:17.290
Contacting all vessels!

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:20.420
All vessels, form up horizontally
and launch your mobile suits!

00:09:20.490 --> 00:09:23.260
Following that,
we'll send out our G3 unit!

00:09:37.380 --> 00:09:41.180
The Titans' mobile suits have entered
Side 2 from the direction of Colony 27!

00:09:41.250 --> 00:09:42.840
They've ignored our warnings!

00:09:43.420 --> 00:09:45.710
How could we allow them
to enter so easily?!

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:47.480
Commence anti-air fire!

00:09:47.550 --> 00:09:49.490
Mr. Mayor, you're being hasty!

00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:51.520
Do you have a better plan?!

00:09:51.890 --> 00:09:53.020
Let's surrender.

00:09:53.090 --> 00:09:54.790
It's still not too late.

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:56.020
Don't be ridiculous!

00:09:56.100 --> 00:09:58.390
You've seen that Colony Laser!

00:09:58.830 --> 00:10:02.290
The Titans don't care one bit
about us Spacenoids!

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:03.130
But...!

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:06.470
The A.E.U.G.'s mobile suits are
entering from the direction of Colony 15!

00:10:17.180 --> 00:10:18.150
There's one!

00:10:27.360 --> 00:10:29.290
Lieutenant Botty! Move back!

00:10:41.140 --> 00:10:42.510
That Barzam's escaping!

00:10:47.280 --> 00:10:48.250
What?!

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:52.080
Gotcha!

00:10:59.890 --> 00:11:00.920
Fa! Get away!

00:11:00.990 --> 00:11:01.960
Kamille!

00:11:06.230 --> 00:11:09.290
The Zeta Gundam! Is it seriously trying
to take out the Baund Doc?!

00:11:14.010 --> 00:11:14.970
It's quick!

00:11:18.010 --> 00:11:18.810
Rosammy?

00:11:21.150 --> 00:11:22.110
Brother?

00:11:28.490 --> 00:11:29.450
Brother!

00:11:29.620 --> 00:11:32.650
You've been captured by the enemy's
Zeta Gundam, haven't you?

00:11:32.790 --> 00:11:34.320
N-No, Rosammy.

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:37.820
If it's really you piloting
that mobile suit...

00:11:38.100 --> 00:11:40.730
...let's return to the white ship
where Shinta and Qum are waiting!

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:41.770
Rosammy!

00:11:42.370 --> 00:11:43.670
Oh, right!

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:45.670
Okay, I'll go.

00:11:57.780 --> 00:11:58.880
What's going on?!

00:12:17.740 --> 00:12:19.140
<i>Rosammy, answer me!</i>

00:12:24.240 --> 00:12:25.470
Rosammy! What in the world?

00:12:25.880 --> 00:12:28.400
Yes, the Zeta dropped the sky...

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:32.420
...and crushed my little brother,
mother and father.

00:12:35.250 --> 00:12:37.750
The sky...The sky will fall...!

00:12:39.590 --> 00:12:42.760
<i>I'm Kamille, your brother!</i>

00:12:42.830 --> 00:12:44.160
<i>I didn't come here...</i>

00:12:44.160 --> 00:12:45.960
...in the Zeta to fight you!

00:12:46.030 --> 00:12:48.500
Rosammy! Let's return to the white ship!

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:51.800
<i>To the ship where your new little brother</i>
<i>and sister are waiting!</i>

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:54.930
Get away from me!
Don't come any closer!

00:13:00.080 --> 00:13:01.640
<i>Kamille, answer me!</i>

00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:03.580
<i>Emma here! I can't see you from here!</i>

00:13:04.080 --> 00:13:05.450
<i>Please give me a little more time!</i>

00:13:06.690 --> 00:13:08.590
The hole in the colony
hasn't been fixed yet!

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:20.490
Lieutenant Rosamia's brainwaves
are weakening.

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:22.900
Can't we increase the level from here?

00:13:23.270 --> 00:13:25.530
I've been trying, but it's not working!

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:49.900
B-Brother.

00:13:50.560 --> 00:13:52.620
- Now, come here.
- Sure.

00:13:58.940 --> 00:14:00.630
- Brother?
- Yeah.

00:14:02.110 --> 00:14:04.840
This machine is drawing you into fighting.

00:14:06.380 --> 00:14:09.350
- Don't damage the Baund Doc!
- This must be done!

00:14:09.520 --> 00:14:12.250
No!! That sound scares me!

00:14:12.490 --> 00:14:13.780
Rosammy!

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:16.220
I'm scared. I really am.

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:18.150
Don't shoot!

00:14:29.270 --> 00:14:33.930
There was a girl that I wanted
to hold in my arms like this forever.

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:36.600
- You mean Fa?
- No.

00:14:36.680 --> 00:14:39.340
The girl protected me in a battle,
and she...!

00:14:40.350 --> 00:14:42.840
- She died?
- Yeah.

00:14:42.920 --> 00:14:44.540
Your girlfriend?

00:14:44.620 --> 00:14:45.740
Not exactly.

00:14:45.990 --> 00:14:48.750
More like the relationship
between you and me.

00:14:48.820 --> 00:14:50.290
Do you understand?

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:51.950
Then she's your big sister!

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:56.520
Huh? That's right. Very clever.

00:14:57.630 --> 00:15:01.530
I can tell, if it has to do with you, Brother!

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:11.310
G3?!

00:15:12.480 --> 00:15:14.970
Have they got no sense of shame
by using poison gas again?!

00:15:25.120 --> 00:15:26.890
I hope I'm not too late!

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:31.390
Colony 13?

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:33.720
Has Mineva escaped?

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:40.240
Unlikely.

00:15:42.940 --> 00:15:44.740
We need a heavier barrage! See to it!

00:15:46.280 --> 00:15:49.840
Our mobile suits need this ship
as a place to return to!

00:15:52.050 --> 00:15:53.250
Give me a damage report!

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:16.040
Lamia!

00:16:16.440 --> 00:16:17.700
She's alive! Hey!

00:16:17.780 --> 00:16:18.940
What's the matter?!

00:16:20.510 --> 00:16:21.480
Char...?

00:16:21.810 --> 00:16:23.650
Mr. Char Aznable.

00:16:23.720 --> 00:16:25.950
Where's Miss Mineva?!

00:16:26.120 --> 00:16:27.610
She's escaped.

00:16:27.890 --> 00:16:29.980
Taken by Miss Haman.

00:16:30.060 --> 00:16:32.050
- I see.
- Mr. Char.

00:16:32.120 --> 00:16:34.560
Please protect Miss Mineva.

00:16:34.930 --> 00:16:37.860
That girl has a very gentle heart.

00:16:38.400 --> 00:16:43.430
It's not as if she was born into
the Zabi Family by choice.

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:46.270
Please, protect Miss Mineva...!

00:16:46.340 --> 00:16:49.030
All right. Rest assured, Lamia.

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:52.810
Thank you.

00:16:54.850 --> 00:16:56.970
<i>Lamia...!</i>

00:17:05.820 --> 00:17:06.790
Kamille?

00:17:07.530 --> 00:17:08.860
Is he here?

00:17:09.800 --> 00:17:11.420
My brother.

00:17:22.340 --> 00:17:25.280
There's another one of the identical model!

00:17:26.050 --> 00:17:27.380
Th-That one's also my ally.

00:17:33.520 --> 00:17:35.380
What's this sensation?!

00:17:37.020 --> 00:17:37.990
Rosammy!

00:17:39.690 --> 00:17:41.320
If possible, please don't kill her.

00:17:41.390 --> 00:17:42.660
I know!

00:17:42.730 --> 00:17:45.460
We'll capture that Newtype
and the Zeta Gundam as well!

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:53.840
What did you bastards do to Rosammy?!

00:17:54.070 --> 00:17:57.200
It's a pain that cannot be experienced
by Oldtypes.

00:17:57.280 --> 00:17:58.240
Damn you!

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:09.320
Gates! Get back here! An enemy!

00:18:09.690 --> 00:18:10.710
The golden one's here!

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:19.830
To be frank, I don't want to be separated
from Rosamia!

00:18:19.900 --> 00:18:22.460
We're merely to observe Rosamia!
It can't be helped!

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:24.860
Is this the same mobile armor I just saw?

00:18:28.010 --> 00:18:30.740
- Where'd we get hit?!
- It's useless! I can't control it!

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:39.650
Rosammy!

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:41.610
Rosammy?

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:43.580
It <i>is</i> Kamille!

00:18:46.360 --> 00:18:47.330
Rosammy?

00:19:18.160 --> 00:19:21.250
Wh-What is this thing?! It even transforms!

00:19:21.330 --> 00:19:22.520
<i>Kamille, get away from it!</i>

00:19:22.590 --> 00:19:23.960
<i>I'm destroying it!</i>

00:19:24.130 --> 00:19:25.060
Rosammy?

00:19:25.130 --> 00:19:26.120
Rosammy!

00:19:26.270 --> 00:19:27.200
Kamille!

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:29.230
Do you have any idea what you're doing?!

00:19:29.540 --> 00:19:31.090
Don't get in it, Rosammy!

00:19:31.540 --> 00:19:32.500
Who are you?

00:19:33.640 --> 00:19:34.470
Rosammy?

00:19:34.870 --> 00:19:38.400
Why are you ordering me around?
Are you my superior?

00:19:38.640 --> 00:19:39.510
Rosammy.

00:19:39.580 --> 00:19:40.840
I'm Kamille!

00:19:40.910 --> 00:19:42.880
I'm your brother!

00:19:43.850 --> 00:19:44.750
What nonsense.

00:19:45.880 --> 00:19:46.850
Rosammy!

00:19:50.690 --> 00:19:51.950
Rosammy, stop it!

00:19:52.020 --> 00:19:53.820
It's me, Kamille!

00:20:03.070 --> 00:20:04.370
Just 'cause you're a child...

00:20:04.440 --> 00:20:06.270
...I'm not willing to save your life.

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:23.010
Rosammy, can't you tell who I am?!

00:20:23.590 --> 00:20:26.420
I'm your brother!

00:20:35.300 --> 00:20:37.270
<i>What's the matter, Kamille?! Fire!</i>

00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:38.770
I can't!

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:40.430
I cannot fire!

00:20:40.510 --> 00:20:42.530
<i>If you don't fire, you're going to die!</i>

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:44.360
I'll crush you!

00:20:47.750 --> 00:20:49.180
<i>Stop it, Rosammy!</i>

00:20:49.250 --> 00:20:53.280
The Zeta Gundam is the greatest enemy of
the Baund Doc, and the Titans!

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:01.560
- We're retreating!
- But...!

00:21:01.630 --> 00:21:02.920
Do you want to die here?!

00:21:03.260 --> 00:21:04.320
Y-Yes, sir.

00:21:08.670 --> 00:21:09.930
They escaped?

00:21:10.000 --> 00:21:12.370
<i>Lieutenant Rosamia! Finish them off!</i>

00:21:12.440 --> 00:21:13.910
Yes, Lieutenant!

00:21:24.550 --> 00:21:26.420
They're coming!

00:21:34.260 --> 00:21:35.950
- From a different direction?
- A fresh force!

00:21:38.600 --> 00:21:40.060
We're completely outnumbered!

00:21:40.130 --> 00:21:42.790
- Lieutenant Rosamia, we're retreating!
- <i>Yes, Lieutenant!</i>

00:21:45.040 --> 00:21:46.270
Stop it!

00:21:46.340 --> 00:21:48.360
- Please don't fire!
- Kamille!

00:21:53.710 --> 00:21:55.680
Why?

00:21:59.820 --> 00:22:02.120
Who's making you fight like that?

00:22:03.990 --> 00:22:07.120
Won't you ever return to the Argama?

00:22:14.300 --> 00:22:17.890
The battle at Side 2 was nothing
but a diversionary operation...

00:22:17.970 --> 00:22:19.230
...planned by Captain Bask.

00:22:20.010 --> 00:22:21.840
While this was happening...

00:22:21.910 --> 00:22:26.340
...Captain Bask was steadily
advancing Gryps 2 toward Granada.

00:22:27.180 --> 00:22:32.640
He plans to destroy the A.E.U.G.'s
stronghold, Granada, using the Colony Laser.

00:22:47.270 --> 00:22:49.600
Oh, I can't help believing you

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
kanarazu aeru to ano hi kara shinjiteita

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
I've believed we're sure to meet again ever since that day

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
kitto yobiau kokoro ga areba

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
If we have heart, we'll be called together again

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
mugen no Energy yobisamasu

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
Awaken the infinite energy

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
aa kizutsukeau mae ni

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
Before you get hurt

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
dekiru koto sagashite Please

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
Find what you can do...Please

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
nagedasanai de kurushii toki koso

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
Don't throw it away because of this painful age

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
itsuka mita aoi sora wo

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
Until the day we gaze up again

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
kitto anata to miageru hi made

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
at the blue sky we once saw

00:23:47.690 --> 00:23:49.160
The laser of Gryps 2...

00:23:49.230 --> 00:23:52.790
...is about to be fired at the city
on the Moon's surface, Granada.

00:23:53.160 --> 00:23:55.790
But with the help of Haman Karn...

00:23:56.170 --> 00:23:59.430
...the A E.U.G. tries to temporarily
render Gryps 2 inoperative.

00:24:01.470 --> 00:24:07.350
Next on Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam,
"Haman's Victory".

00:24:07.350 --> 00:24:10.050
You will see the tears of time.

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:12.440
Next Episode

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:12.440
Haman's Victory
